  message: "STAGE 2 MERGED, PR 1177: c 35 -> 0 (tmux), rust 5 -> 0 (just), ruby 3 -> 0 (postal), csharp 3 -> 0 (livebook). All src moves were out -> in, with 0 edges lost. C's analyze() override never set the per-file symbol list, and rust's span index was keyed through qualified names; both are fixed. The aardvark-dns recorded fixture was re-pinned (twins 130 -> 132) because the same rust fix re-anchored 3 calls there. REMAINING: haskell 119 (a multi-equation function's span is too short; the anchor is right), javascript 135 and typescript 33 (prototype methods, callbacks), then the cross-language containment gate."  # 9a00
