  message: "STAGE 3 MERGED, PR #1178: haskell 119 -> 0 (xmonad, hadolint). A different mechanism, as the row said: the ANCHOR was right, because the lookup is by name and haskell names are unique per module, but the symbol spanned only its first equation. The span now runs to the last equation. REMAINING: javascript 135, typescript 33, then the cross-language gate."  # dc21
- op: discuss  # b6eb
  at: '2026-09-24T11:09:53Z'  # b6eb
  by: agent  # b6eb
